---
import { ExternalLink, Compass, BookOpen, Rocket, ArrowRight, ShieldCheck, Github } from 'lucide-astro';
---

<section id="projectes" class="py-16 md:py-24 relative">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16 space-y-4">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-ocean-100 text-ocean-800 dark:bg-ocean-950 dark:text-ocean-300 border border-ocean-200 dark:border-ocean-800">
        <span>🚀 Ecosistema balears.tech</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">
        Projectes cívics actius i oberts a tothom
      </h2>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
        Infraestructures digitals públiques, 100% lliures i al servei de la joventut, la cultura i la comunitat balear.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Grid of Projects -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      
      <!-- Card 1: escoltes.balears.tech -->
      <div class="flex flex-col justify-between bg-white dark:bg-surface-cardDark rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-subtle hover:shadow-elevated transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden group">
        <div>
          <!-- Thumbnail Image -->
          <div class="relative h-48 overflow-hidden bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800">
            <img
              src="/assets/img/escoltes.jpg"
              alt="escoltes.balears.tech portal de rutes i acampades a Mallorca"
              width="600"
              height="350"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300"
              loading="lazy"
            />
            <div class="absolute top-3 left-3 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
              <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[11px] font-bold bg-white/90 dark:bg-slate-900/90 text-teal-700 dark:text-teal-300 backdrop-blur-xs">
                Codi Obert
              </span>
              <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[11px] font-bold bg-white/90 dark:bg-slate-900/90 text-ocean-700 dark:text-ocean-300 backdrop-blur-xs">
                Joventut
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Card Content -->
          <div class="p-6 sm:p-7 space-y-4">
            <div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                <span class="text-xs font-mono font-semibold text-teal-600 dark:text-teal-400">
                  escoltes.balears.tech
                </span>
                <Compass class="w-4 h-4 text-slate-400" />
              </div>
              <h3 class="mt-1 text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
                Portal d'excursions i acampades per a l'escoltisme
              </h3>
            </div>

            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
              Plataforma col·laborativa 100% lliure i voluntària. Més de <strong class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">65 rutes catalogades</strong> per unitats escoltes, <strong class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">45 refugis i zones d'acampada legal</strong>, integració de la xarxa de transport TIB, dades d'AEMET i consells d'emergències (112, IBANAT).
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Card Footer Link -->
        <div class="p-6 sm:p-7 pt-0 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800/80 mt-auto">
          <a
            href="https://escoltes.balears.tech"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-between w-full px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-sm font-bold bg-ocean-50 hover:bg-ocean-100 dark:bg-ocean-950/80 dark:hover:bg-ocean-900 text-ocean-700 dark:text-ocean-300 transition-colors"
          >
            <span>Obrir escoltes.balears.tech</span>
            <ExternalLink class="w-4 h-4" />
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2: jisho.balears.tech -->
      <div class="flex flex-col justify-between bg-white dark:bg-surface-cardDark rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-subtle hover:shadow-elevated transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden group">
        <div>
          <!-- Thumbnail Image -->
          <div class="relative h-48 overflow-hidden bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800">
            <img
              src="/assets/img/jisho.jpg"
              alt="jisho.balears.tech diccionari japonès-espanyol lliure"
              width="600"
              height="350"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300"
              loading="lazy"
            />
            <div class="absolute top-3 left-3 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
              <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[11px] font-bold bg-white/90 dark:bg-slate-900/90 text-teal-700 dark:text-teal-300 backdrop-blur-xs">
                Cloud Run
              </span>
              <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[11px] font-bold bg-white/90 dark:bg-slate-900/90 text-ocean-700 dark:text-ocean-300 backdrop-blur-xs">
                Dades Obertes
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Card Content -->
          <div class="p-6 sm:p-7 space-y-4">
            <div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                <span class="text-xs font-mono font-semibold text-teal-600 dark:text-teal-400">
                  jisho.balears.tech
                </span>
                <BookOpen class="w-4 h-4 text-slate-400" />
              </div>
              <h3 class="mt-1 text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
                Murasaki no Jisho — Diccionari japonès obert
              </h3>
            </div>

            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
              Diccionari obert japonès-espanyol interactiu amb més de <strong class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">34.300 entrades</strong>, kanji, hiragana, rōmaji i pronunciació d'àudio. Arquitectura serverless eficient a Google Cloud Run alimentada per bases de dades lliures internacionals (JMdict, KANJIDIC2 i Tatoeba).
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Card Footer Link -->
        <div class="p-6 sm:p-7 pt-0 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800/80 mt-auto">
          <a
            href="https://jisho.balears.tech"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-between w-full px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-sm font-bold bg-ocean-50 hover:bg-ocean-100 dark:bg-ocean-950/80 dark:hover:bg-ocean-900 text-ocean-700 dark:text-ocean-300 transition-colors"
          >
            <span>Obrir jisho.balears.tech</span>
            <ExternalLink class="w-4 h-4" />
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3: dni.balears.tech (ProtegeDNI) -->
      <div class="flex flex-col justify-between bg-white dark:bg-surface-cardDark rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-subtle hover:shadow-elevated transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden group">
        <div>
          <!-- Thumbnail Image -->
          <div class="relative h-48 overflow-hidden bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800">
            <img
              src="/assets/img/dni.jpg"
              alt="dni.balears.tech ProtegeDNI anonimitzador segur de DNI de codi obert"
              width="600"
              height="350"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300"
              loading="lazy"
            />
            <div class="absolute top-3 left-3 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
              <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[11px] font-bold bg-white/90 dark:bg-slate-900/90 text-teal-700 dark:text-teal-300 backdrop-blur-xs">
                Codi Obert
              </span>
              <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[11px] font-bold bg-white/90 dark:bg-slate-900/90 text-ocean-700 dark:text-ocean-300 backdrop-blur-xs">
                Privadesa AEPD
              </span>
              <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[11px] font-bold bg-white/90 dark:bg-slate-900/90 text-coral-700 dark:text-coral-300 backdrop-blur-xs">
                100% Local
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Card Content -->
          <div class="p-6 sm:p-7 space-y-4">
            <div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                <span class="text-xs font-mono font-semibold text-teal-600 dark:text-teal-400">
                  dni.balears.tech
                </span>
                <ShieldCheck class="w-4 h-4 text-teal-500" />
              </div>
              <h3 class="mt-1 text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
                ProtegeDNI — Anonimització i privadesa local
              </h3>
            </div>

            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
              Filtre i ofuscador segur de documents d'identitat (DNI) per compartir còpies protegides segons recomanacions de l'<strong class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">AEPD</strong> i Policia Nacional. Pixelat i desenfocament de signatura, CAN, número de suport i MRZ, marques d'aigua de finalitat i conversió B/N. <strong class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Zero servidors</strong>: processament en memòria al navegador.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Card Footer Links -->
        <div class="p-6 sm:p-7 pt-0 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800/80 mt-auto space-y-2">
          <a
            href="https://dni.balears.tech"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-between w-full px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-sm font-bold bg-ocean-50 hover:bg-ocean-100 dark:bg-ocean-950/80 dark:hover:bg-ocean-900 text-ocean-700 dark:text-ocean-300 transition-colors"
          >
            <span>Obrir dni.balears.tech</span>
            <ExternalLink class="w-4 h-4" />
          </a>
          <a
            href="https://github.com/GabrielRullan/dni-blur"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-between w-full px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-semibold bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 transition-colors"
          >
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <Github class="w-3.5 h-3.5" />
              <span>Codi a GitHub (GabrielRullan/dni-blur)</span>
            </span>
            <ExternalLink class="w-3 h-3 text-slate-400" />
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 4: Incubador de Nous Projectes Cívics -->
      <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-center justify-between gap-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-teal-500/10 via-ocean-500/10 to-coral-500/10 dark:from-teal-950/40 dark:via-ocean-950/40 dark:to-slate-900/40 rounded-2xl border-2 border-dashed border-teal-500/40 dark:border-teal-500/30 p-6 sm:p-7 lg:p-8 shadow-subtle hover:shadow-elevated transition-all duration-300 md:col-span-2 lg:col-span-3">
        <div class="space-y-4 max-w-3xl">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-[11px] font-bold bg-teal-500 text-white shadow-xs">
              Crida Oberta
            </span>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono font-semibold text-teal-600 dark:text-teal-400">
              *.balears.tech
            </span>
            <Rocket class="w-5 h-5 text-teal-600 dark:text-teal-400 ml-auto sm:ml-0" />
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
              Incubador de Nous Projectes Cívics
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1">
              Tens una iniciativa d'interès públic per a les Balears?
            </p>
          </div>

          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            Allotgem i acompanyem el teu projecte cívic. Oferim allotjament gratuït, subdomini propi sota <strong class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-ocean-700 dark:text-ocean-300">*.balears.tech</strong>, arquitectura estàtica o serverless (Firebase Hosting / Cloud Run) i assessorament tècnic per a iniciatives ciutadanes, culturals o educatives sense ànim de lucre.
          </p>

          <ul class="text-xs grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-2 sm:gap-4 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 pt-1">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-teal-600 dark:text-teal-400 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span>Hosting i subdomini 100% de franc</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-teal-600 dark:text-teal-400 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span>Assessorament d'arquitectura web i dades</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-teal-600 dark:text-teal-400 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span>Visibilitat i difusió comunitària</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="lg:shrink-0 lg:pl-6 pt-4 lg:pt-0 border-t lg:border-t-0 lg:border-l border-teal-500/20 flex flex-col justify-center">
          <a
            href="#contacte"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-xl text-sm font-bold bg-teal-600 hover:bg-teal-700 text-white shadow-sm transition-colors text-center whitespace-nowrap"
          >
            <span>Sol·licita un subdomini cívic</span>
            <ArrowRight class="w-4 h-4" />
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
